19488-      <section class="function-design-embed" id="function-design-m04-09-m04-09_admin_stock_stock_move_transfer_register_edit" data-source="functions/ec-cube-enterprise/m04-09_admin_stock_stock_move_transfer_register_edit.md">
19489-        <header class="function-design-header">
19490-          <p class="function-design-source">Source:<br>functions/ec-cube-enterprise/m04-09_admin_stock_stock_move_transfer_register_edit.md</p>
